BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup Lets Walkprogram": "https://www.meetup.com/lets-walkprogram/events/316499392/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_lets_walkprogram
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Let's Walk!!
UID:event_316499392@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260919T042226Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260920T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260920T150000
SUMMARY:Walk at Grover Cleveland Park
DESCRIPTION:Let's Walk!!\n**MEETING TIME 1:55 PM**\n\nWe will meet near th
 e fishing pond entrance of the park\, close to Brookside Avenue and the bo
 at house/restrooms.\n**GPS location: 138 Brookside Ave\, Caldwell. Park on
  the street.**\n\nWe will walk for about 60-90 minutes at about a 3 miles/
 hour pace. The park has a paved path loop that is a little more than a mil
 e. Stay for as many loops as you like.\n\nWe'll meet in front of the fishi
 ng pond at 1:55 and begin promptly at 2.\n\nGrover Cleveland Park in Caldw
 ell/Essex Fells celebrated its centennial in 2013. As the first county par
 k in western Essex County\, the site was originally selected for its natur
 al beauty and its potential to provide a space for relaxation and recreati
 on. It contains gentle rolling hills\, broad meadows and other environment
 ally aesthetic features\n\n**Please arrive 5 minutes early\, so we can sta
 rt on time.**\n\nFOLLOW US ON INSTAGRAM - letswalkmeetup\n\nDisclaimer: If
  you join us for a hike\, please understand that you are responsible for y
 our own preparedness and well-being and will hold no one else liable in ca
 se of injury or mishap. Event will be canceled in the event of extreme wea
 ther.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lets-walkprogram/events/316499392/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260910T143303Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260910T143303Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Thespaceforart": "https://thespaceforart.com/event/tantra-date-for-couples-an-exploration-through-the-senses/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:thespaceforart
X-SOURCE:The Space For Art
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260920T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260920T180000
DTSTAMP:20260908T210447Z
CREATED:20260908T210447Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260908T210447Z
UID:10334-1789912800-1789927200@thespaceforart.com
SUMMARY:Tantra Date for Couples: An Exploration Through the Senses
DESCRIPTION:Couples\, \nDiscover the art of conscious connection through awakening the senses. \nMost couples crave deeper touch\, intimacy\, and emotional connection. Yet\, few of us were ever taught how to create experiences that genuinely feel extraordinary for both partners. \nWelcome to a brand-new\, transformational date night designed to change that. These are guided experiential practices designed to help couples strengthen intimacy\, communication\, trust\, and connection through simple but powerful embodied practices. \nWhether you are completely new to this work or have attended our events before\, this experience is entirely new and different. It offers a safe\, sacred\, and nurturing space to step away from the noise of daily life and step into your bodies. Together\, you will be guided on an immersive journey through the five senses—unlocking the unique wisdom\, pleasure\, and healing that each one has to offer. \nBy the end of the event\, you will have a deeper understanding of the transformative power of the senses and their role in accessing deeper states of pleasure and connection. You will leave feeling more grounded\, present\, connected to your body\, connected to your partner\, and with a renewed sense of vitality and passion for life and will know how to re-create these experiences at home. \nTantra is a path of awakening and exploration that helps us move out of ordinary states into a sense of heightened awareness\, expanded sensation. intimacy and mindfulness. \nWhat You Will Experience Together \n\nThe Power of Touch: Learn how conscious\, intentional touch becomes a direct gateway to deeper intimacy and sensual embodiment.\nSensory Awakening: Activate your senses through curated experiences with communication\, mindfulness\, smell\, taste\, and sound.\nElevated States: Discover how Tantra helps you move out of ordinary routines and into heightened awareness\, expanded sensation\, and profound bliss.\nSafe Exploration: Participate in gentle\, expertly guided practices designed to build deep mutual trust and comfort.\n\nFIRST TIMERS INTERVIEW with the organizer is required to attend. Please TEXT Olga before ordering tickets. (862) 251-2444 Once you’ve spoken with me you are ‘IN’ and may attend all future events. Attendance is at the discretion of the organizer. \nDATE: Sunday\, September 20th. \nTIME: 2:00 – 6:00 Doors open at 2:00. We begin at 2:15. \nREGISTER: http://bit.ly/4ble0iz \nCOST: Early Bird $299.00 (plus fees)\, Regular Admission $333.00 \nVENMO or other payment methods are available\, so you don’t have to pay the additional fees. TEXT me (862) 251-2444 to find out how to pay with Venmo or Zelle. \nSPACE IS LIMITED and events are advertised in multiple places. You MUST pre-purchase your ticket. \nLOCATION: The Space\, 356 Bloomfield Ave\, Montclair\, NJ 07042 \nBONUS: Couples Zoom Coaching Call with me. Schedule it after the event to help you integrate what you learned\, troubleshoot what gets in the way\, and keep your relationship moving forward together. \nWHAT TO BRING: Water Bottle. Wear comfortable clothes that allow movement. \nREFRESHMENTS: Healthy refreshments are provided halfway thought the event. \nPLEASE REFRAIN from wearing scented products to respect those with chemical sensitivities. \nThere is NO NUDITY or sexual touch in this workshop. SAFETY and PERSONAL BOUNDARIES are strictly adhered to at our events. \nREFUNDS: There are NO refunds. If you TEXT the organizer within 24 hours of the event\, you can use your ticket for our next monthly event. Please TEXT Olga  (862) 251-2444. \nWHAT PARTICIPANTS ARE SAYING: \n-I felt a connection with my spouse I’ve never been able to express with her before. Mike \n-I felt my feelings. I felt truly loved by my spouse. Terry \n-The gentleness of your guidance allowed me to trust in myself and my feelings. Beth \n-I learned simple tools to use in our day-to-day practice. You will leave with more than you came with. Do it!! Venera \n-The pace was excellent. I appreciated the mix of teaching and practice. This was a great experience\, even for the non-spiritual sceptic. It will open your heart and mind in beautiful ways. Bob \n-Take it to help increase openness and communication through shared love and beautiful experiences. Mark \n-Try it! Great practical tools and rituals. There is so much to learn and grow in as a couple. Made me very excited to learn more! Debbie \n-Creating slow time to connect with your partner with guided exercises is so special. Jamie \n-Olga and Bob offer great information\, a loving and safe environment\, and a playful place for couples to find themselves again. Thank you! Maddi \n-It was a great introduction to tantra and developing daily practices to increase and grow intimacy with your partner. Bobby \n-Personal improvement on your relationship\, on how to love better because we aren’t taught how to do so in the first place. JP \n-It’s important to step out of your comfort zone and try something new. This class helps achieve that as well as deeper connectivity and playfulness with your partner. Thank you! Stephanie \n-Great way to be closer to your partner\, great way to get unstuck. It’s just fun! Jim \n-Olga and Bob lead a fantastic workshop for couples to deepen their love and connection and left us with tools to take home and use to continue deeper love. Michael \nYOUR PRESENTERS \nOlga Ribble is a Certified Skydancing Tantra Presenter and Intimacy Coach. With extensive training from world-renowned teachers\, she guides couples to develop better communication and intimacy skills\, leading to fulfilling emotional\, physical\, and spiritual partnerships. https://nordicgoddesstantra.com/ \n‘Cool Dude’ Bob a lifelong teacher and student\, spent over a decade delving into the transformative world of Tantra. Through Tantra\, Bob discovered practices that enhance masculine potency\, foster deeper intimacy and pleasure\, offering a holistic approach that enriches personal and relational experiences. He assists his partner Olga in teaching couples and men’s programs.
URL:https://thespaceforart.com/event/tantra-date-for-couples-an-exploration-through-the-senses/
CATEGORIES:Wellness
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://thespaceforart.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Screenshot-2025-11-05-at-8.58.55-PM.png
END:VEVENT
