 e High and their search for the American dream — a dream inspired by fami
 ly\, fueled by sports\, and complicated by the US/Mexican border. Soccer 
 player Erik dreams of playing professionally\; wrestler Shyanne sees the 
 army as a ticket to college\; and pitcher Francisco plays each game think
 ing of his dad who isn't allowed into the US.]\n\nHosted by: Sprague Libr
 ary\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://montclair.campusla
