DESCRIPTION:This is a free Adult School program.\n\n Ada C.M. Thomas\, 
 author of Aminata: Abbey Lincoln's Song of Faith and Dr. Paul Johson 
 Edwards discuss the enduring legacy of singer\, poet and actress Abbey 
 Lincoln. Veronica Nunn and Pheeroan Aklaff will a quartet in an 
 accompanying tribute concert. Book signing to follow.\n\nIn partnership 
 with the Peter Bodge & Seed Artists Jazz Library.
LOCATION:Montclair Main - Auditorium\, Montclair Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Adult School":MAILTO:adultschool@montclairlibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Adult School, Books, Film & Theater, Music
