DESCRIPTION:Join the Student Government Association for a constitutional m
 eeting where we discuss campus business including\, but not limited to\, 
 programming events\, community service initiatives\, improvements of stud
 ent life\, leadership\, and engagement.\n \nWe welcome all students\, fau
