 t it to be. From fluffy to glittery\, you’ll craft a one‑of‑a‑kind creati
 on that’s totally yours. \nHow do I sign-up?\n\nFree with Student ID\nNo 
 registration required\n\nWhere and when?\n\nTuesday\, September 29th\, 20
