DESCRIPTION:This workshop will cover key concepts such as online etiquette
 \, source evaluation\, cyberbullying\, and digital footprints— critical s
 kills in today’s tech-saturated world. Educators will engage in interacti
 ve activities and discussions that highlight real-world classroom applica
 tions. By the end of the session\, participants will walk away with ready
 -to-use strategies and resources to empower students to think critically\
 , act ethically\, and participate safely in digital spaces.\n\nHosted by:
