SUMMARY:Teen D&D (9th - 12th Graders)
DESCRIPTION:Join Game master Gio for a high seas pirate themed D&D 
 adventure! The seas call out as a new found island has been recently 
 discovered\, with your crew being tasked to investigate! Come learn to play 
 D&D as you sail the high seas\, befriend or vanquish mysterious creatures\, 
 and maybe find some buried treasure! The first session will be session 0\, 
 where we will be creating your characters and going over the 
 rules/expectations for the game! (PLEASE NOTE THIS SESSION WE WILL NOT BE 
 PLAYING\, IT IS THE SETUP SESSION FOR FUTURE GAMES) Dice and dice trays 
 will be provided. Registration required.\n\n
LOCATION:Montclair Main - Teen Room\, Montclair Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Library":MAILTO:events@montclairlibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Teen Services, Games
UID:LibCal-10306-17665189
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/17665189
