 n Henderson\, Esq. introduces the Business Legacy Blueprint™\, a practic
 al framework that helps entrepreneurs protect their business\, prepare suc
 cessors\, and preserve the mission and culture that make their enterprise 
 unique. Participants will learn how to: Identify the three pillars of busi
 ness legacy: assets\, people\, and values Bridge the gap between personal 
 estate planning and business continuity Build a simple\, effective success
 ion plan — even if they’re not ready to retire Protect their business 
 from disruption during emergencies or transitions Create a valu
