DESCRIPTION:\nDouglas Carter Beane (book) and Lewis Flinn (music and lyric
 s)\nLysistrata Jones (musical) is a pop infused musical comedy about a lo
 sing college basketball team and the girlfriends who refuse intimacy unti
 l the team finally wins. What starts as a protest becomes a story about r
 elationships\, accountability\, and finding your voice. Runtime: approxim
 ately 2 hours 10 minutes (including intermission).\n\nMontclair State Uni
 versity Students FREE with ID at Kasser Box Office\n\n\nHosted by: The Co
 llege of the Arts\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://mont
 clair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12607743
DTEND:20261010T010000Z
DTSTAMP:20260919T042233Z
