  19Our new family program\, Nature Explorers\, is a free program offered o
 n select Saturdays. Each session will be host to a different garden or nat
 ure inspired activity such as\, “adopting” a tree\, creating and addin
 g to a community art project\, seasonal scavenger hunts\, finding art in n
 ature\, bird watching\, and more! Programming is designed for ages 5 and u
 p\, but all are welcome!Please Note: This is a drop-in program but not a d
 rop-off 
