SUMMARY:Women’s Health and Sleep Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Jacqueline Morgado\, RPSGT\, Lead Technologist\, The Center for Sleep Disorders at Cooperman Barnabas Medical Center\, will discuss how your sleep schedule and bedtime habits can affect your daily life. \n  \nFree and open to the public / Registration required \nRegister\n  \nFor more information: Ellen Robertson\, erobertson@jccmetrowest.org or (973) 530-3415. \n  \nSponsored by
