DESCRIPTION:Virtual MeditationWednesdays\, 7:00 PM – 9:00 PMSeptember 9\
 , 16\, 23October 7\, 14\, 21\, 28November 4\, 11\, 18December 2\, 9\, 16In
 structor:John WelshonsJoin contemporary spiritual teacher and author Raman
 anda John E. Welshons (One Soul\, One Love\, One Heart\; When Prayers Aren
 ’t Answered\; andAwakening From Grief) for a series of evening mindfulne
 ss meditation classes in the comfort of your home via Zoom. These classes 
 focus on specific practices for alleviating fear and anxiety and finding i
