 library! Create a festive Halloween-themed charm for your bag or phone\, 
 paint a spooky or Halloween-inspired rock\, and design your own Halloween 
 bead bracelet to take home. Stop by anytime during the program to craft\, 
 decorate\, and enjoy some Halloween-inspired creativity.\n\nAll materials 
 will be provided while supplies last. No registration required—just drop 
