SUMMARY:Sourdough Starter Class
DESCRIPTION:Slow down\, connect\, and explore the meaning of bread as 
 nourishment\, tradition\, and an expression of love. Inspired by Bread Is 
 Love by Pooja Makhijani\, this gathering combines a thoughtful reading with 
 a hands-on introduction to sourdough. Participants will learn the basics of 
 starting and caring for a sourdough starter—and take one home to continue 
 the ritual in their own kitchen.\n\nRegistration required.
