 and Heal.\n\nThe Medicine you have been searching for lives within you. 
 Follow the path of the 13 Ojibwe Moons with Animal Spirits and Ancestors as 
 your guides as you unlock your connection to your own unique\, inherent 
 healing power. Through storytelling\, ceremonies\, and Shamanic journeys\, 
 learn to apply ancient wisdom to your life in ways that are respectful and 
