DESCRIPTION:<b><b>Sunday\, November 29</b></b><span> is the first day of t
 he new Church Year. What a great time to<span> </span></span><b><b>welcom
 e new households into our Church Family</b></b><span>. During the<span> <
 /span></span><b><b>10am service</b></b><span><span> </span>we will ask ne
 w parishioners to share what brought them to Holy Spirit Verona and we wil
 l renew our Baptismal vows together with our newest family members.</span>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260805T161042Z
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
X-SOURCE:Church of the Holy Spirit Verona
END:VEVENT
