 s</b></b> each month\; doors open and BINGO cards go on sale at 6pm. Entra
 nce fee (with sheets for ten games) is<span> </span><b><b>$20</b></b>\; t
 he first number is called at 7pm. Snacks and beverages will be available f
 or purchase\, and you are welcome to bring your own food. No alcohol is al
 lowed and you must be 18 years old to play BINGO. <p><b><b>Additional set 
 of sheets may be purchased for $15</b></b> and extra sheets for our cove
 r-all game (Game #10) can be purchased for $5.</p>
